    "detailed_description": "Play as a scientist who is the victim of a failed experiment and free his soul trapped inside an energy cube. Or play in local co-op with the scientist's young granddaughter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805340/extras/c53c7433412cc835de06965cfa66fb20.avif?t=1709918950\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An atmospheric single-player or local co-op adventure in a strange and poetic world governed by a unique set of rules to get your body back</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A well-thought-out level design with varied and challenging mechanics that require both skill and reflection</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 200+ unique and dangerous levels to explore with an increasing difficulty </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A lot of bonuses and secrets to collect in order to unlock shortcuts, hidden levels,...</li></ul><br><i>Jump, Wall Jump, Phase,...</i>  Phase !! What is it ?<br><br>Simple and intuitive controls are complemented by a unique power: phasing. Use this power to pass through blocks, interact with visual glitches... to progress through the adventure in search of your lost body.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805340/extras/84ce93b15280257aa1a62db02b3d7df1.avif?t=1709918950\" width=600 height=168 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Play as a scientist who is the victim of a failed experiment and free his soul trapped inside an energy cube. Or play in local co-op with the scientist's young granddaughter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805340/extras/c53c7433412cc835de06965cfa66fb20.avif?t=1709918950\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An atmospheric single-player or local co-op adventure in a strange and poetic world governed by a unique set of rules to get your body back</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A well-thought-out level design with varied and challenging mechanics that require both skill and reflection</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 200+ unique and dangerous levels to explore with an increasing difficulty </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A lot of bonuses and secrets to collect in order to unlock shortcuts, hidden levels,...</li></ul><br><i>Jump, Wall Jump, Phase,...</i>  Phase !! What is it ?<br><br>Simple and intuitive controls are complemented by a unique power: phasing. Use this power to pass through blocks, interact with visual glitches... to progress through the adventure in search of your lost body.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805340/extras/84ce93b15280257aa1a62db02b3d7df1.avif?t=1709918950\" width=600 height=168 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Play as a scientist who is the victim of a failed experiment. Free his soul trapped inside an energy cube in this puzzle platformer. Experience the adventure in local co-op with the scientist's young granddaughter.",
